sentences.l:
For indeed his dear son, with godlike Odysseus,
to Ilios of-fine-foals had gone in hollow ships,
Antiphus the spearman;

So he spoke, and rejoiced at the omen-word Odysseus' dear son,
nor then any longer long did he sit, but was eager to speak,
and stood in the middle of the assembly;

who to the house of her father shrink from going,
Icarius, so that he himself might settle-the-marriage-gifts for his daughter,
and give her to whom he wished and who came to him welcome;

Feel-indignation, you yourselves too,
and before other men feel shame, the neighbouring men
who dwell round about;
